505
00:34:27.983 --> 00:34:30.777
walang halaga, at walang pananagutan.

506
00:34:31.403 --> 00:34:34.281
Walang makapagsalita para sa iyo, Ms. Lee.

507
00:34:34.990 --> 00:34:36.658
Ikaw lang ang makakagawa nito.

508
00:34:36.741 --> 00:34:38.868
Mangyaring lumaban kasama
ang taong mahal mo.

509
00:34:39.494 --> 00:34:40.912
