545
00:37:45.847 --> 00:37:46.890
Mainggit sila sayo

546
00:37:47.640 --> 00:37:49.768
dahil mahal ka sa isang paraan...

547
00:37:52.103 --> 00:37:53.855
hindi nila alam.

548
00:37:55.774 --> 00:37:58.359
Itaas mo ang iyong ulo at tumingin sa akin.

549
00:38:10.497 --> 00:38:12.624
Balita ko masarap talaga ang black tea nila.

550
00:38:16.461 --> 00:38:18.671
Alam kong mahilig ka sa black tea.

551
00:38:18.755 --> 00:38:22.467
Nagpapanic ako kanina,
ngunit naghanap pa rin ako ng lugar na gusto mo,

552
00:38:23.134 --> 00:38:25.220
para lang i-treat ka ng masarap.

553
00:38:27.222 --> 00:38:28.431
salamat po.

554
00:38:29.098 --> 00:38:30.642
Magsimula tayo ulit.

555
00:38:45.031 --> 00:38:46.574
Kang Hyo-min, aking sinta,

556
00:38:47.784 --> 00:38:50.286
papakasalan mo ako?

557
00:38:52.997 --> 00:38:54.457
